WEBVTT

00:00:00.930 --> 00:00:04.290
A miracle that you're longing to feel!

00:00:04.290 --> 00:00:07.680
Awaken returner! You just wish for it!

00:00:07.680 --> 00:00:10.500
Excitement until you hit the limit,

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:13.170
and want more, more, more, and more!

00:00:12.340 --> 00:00:15.830
<i>My name is Maimai Yuzuriha! 
I'm a second-year in high school!</i>

00:00:16.070 --> 00:00:19.450
<i>And yes, I have thought my own name 
was weird a few times before!</i>

00:00:24.630 --> 00:00:26.080
I did it again...

00:00:26.760 --> 00:00:27.620
Oh, well!

00:00:28.270 --> 00:00:29.970
It's pretty, like a kaleidoscope!

00:00:32.350 --> 00:00:35.410
<i>Now it's time for Maimai 
to hit the bath again!</i>

00:00:35.410 --> 00:00:38.740
<i>A toasty bath that's always waiting for me!</i>

00:00:39.980 --> 00:00:41.530
Good afternoon!

00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:45.690
Let's see, women's bath, women's bath...

00:00:44.730 --> 00:00:47.690
<b>Men</b>

00:00:53.680 --> 00:00:58.740
<i>Once I pop out of the bath, I'll guzzle 
down a tasty bottle of fruit milk!</i>

00:01:00.170 --> 00:01:02.450
<i>Time to get my bath on—</i>

00:01:35.990 --> 00:01:37.490
<b>Episode 7
Maimai Revolution SAGA</b>

00:01:37.490 --> 00:01:38.990
<b>Zombie Land Saga 
Revenge</b>

00:01:39.490 --> 00:01:43.230
So... we have a new member today...

00:01:45.070 --> 00:01:47.680
This is Franchouchou's Number 
Seven... Please clap.

00:01:48.980 --> 00:01:50.430
Applause, people!

00:01:50.430 --> 00:01:52.530
Um, I'm not sure what 
you're trying to say...

00:01:52.530 --> 00:01:54.300
You sure you're not sure? 
Seems kinda obvious!

00:01:54.560 --> 00:01:57.270
You only went to the bathhouse 
because the plumbing's busted, right?

00:01:57.270 --> 00:01:59.480
Is that mummy-looking thing... a  person?

00:01:59.770 --> 00:02:02.350
You ever hear about an idol group 
with non-human members before?!

00:02:02.350 --> 00:02:03.680
You're saying she's dead?!

00:02:03.680 --> 00:02:06.980
Wow, you're worried about that?! 
You're gonna let that bother you?

00:02:06.980 --> 00:02:08.160
Damn right we are!

00:02:08.160 --> 00:02:10.080
Not to worry, ladies!

00:02:10.080 --> 00:02:13.220
I've got the wheels on the zombie 
machine turning already!

00:02:13.220 --> 00:02:14.760
Holy crap, she's really dead?

00:02:14.760 --> 00:02:16.470
Where did you find her?!

00:02:16.470 --> 00:02:18.730
What? What, what, what?

00:02:19.290 --> 00:02:24.070
Come on, now. I didn't "find her." 
I was... guided to her.

00:02:24.070 --> 00:02:24.880
By who, exactly?

00:02:24.880 --> 00:02:26.240
How the hell do I know?!

00:02:26.240 --> 00:02:29.190
You know all these shrines and 
temples and stuff around Saga?!

00:02:29.190 --> 00:02:30.370
They got gods crammed all up in them!

00:02:30.640 --> 00:02:32.240
Shades, what the hell...?

00:02:32.670 --> 00:02:34.500
It wasn't me...

00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:36.430
I didn't do it!

00:02:36.430 --> 00:02:37.880
You're seriously losing it.

00:02:37.880 --> 00:02:39.020
Then how did she—

00:02:39.020 --> 00:02:41.460
I said I didn't do it, damn it!

00:03:04.370 --> 00:03:06.630
It's moving! It's moving!

00:03:05.780 --> 00:03:08.110
Dummy! Corpses don't move 
around on their own!

00:03:08.110 --> 00:03:09.150
Just look at her!

00:03:09.150 --> 00:03:10.590
You don't move around anymore after you die!

00:03:20.200 --> 00:03:23.640
Um... So, you're dead, right?

00:03:24.390 --> 00:03:26.250
Wait, did I die?

00:03:36.750 --> 00:03:39.280
Why exactly didn't you double check?

00:03:39.560 --> 00:03:43.570
You realize dragging a living high school 
student here is ordinary kidnapping, right?

00:03:43.760 --> 00:03:46.130
She... figured out we're zombies, right?

00:03:46.130 --> 00:03:49.450
Looks like it. She's staring holes in you.

00:03:52.570 --> 00:03:55.380
Well, as long as she doesn't 
realize we're Franchou—

00:03:55.380 --> 00:03:57.720
Excuse me, you're Franchouchou's 
Number One, right?

00:03:58.850 --> 00:04:02.200
I knew it! I thought I'd seen
 her somewhere before!

00:04:02.200 --> 00:04:03.070
She goes to our shows!

00:04:09.110 --> 00:04:12.430
The girl in the glasses who 
always comes to see us!

00:04:13.820 --> 00:04:17.510
I knew it! I'm a huge fan 
of yours, Number One!

00:04:17.510 --> 00:04:19.740
I had no idea Franchouchou were zombies!

00:04:19.960 --> 00:04:21.490
Well, there it is.

00:04:21.800 --> 00:04:25.220
Moments like this can really come 
out of the blue, can't they?

00:04:25.660 --> 00:04:26.860
What now?

00:04:27.280 --> 00:04:29.060
The way I see it...

00:04:29.060 --> 00:04:31.630
She'll have to die.

00:04:33.380 --> 00:04:36.290
But that's probably not the best idea.

00:04:37.080 --> 00:04:39.000
Oh, it's okay!

00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:41.900
I mean, you're looking 
a little sickly and banged up,

00:04:41.900 --> 00:04:45.180
but I normally can't tell 
you're zombies at all!

00:04:45.180 --> 00:04:48.360
On stage, you're all so cute and pretty!

00:04:48.360 --> 00:04:49.720
Is that makeup?!

00:04:49.970 --> 00:04:52.050
She's taking this pretty lightly, huh?

00:04:52.050 --> 00:04:55.020
Maybe zombies don't come 
as that big of a surprise?

00:04:55.020 --> 00:04:56.420
Sakura, you were shot!

00:04:56.420 --> 00:04:57.440
A few times, yeah...

00:04:57.740 --> 00:05:01.570
Uh, well, regarding the 
matter of the zombieness...

00:05:01.570 --> 00:05:02.820
if you could just...

00:05:04.010 --> 00:05:06.750
Please don't tell anyone! I'm begging you!

00:05:07.160 --> 00:05:08.650
Come on, you guys are in this, too!

00:05:13.830 --> 00:05:14.740
Diiing!

00:05:15.780 --> 00:05:20.720
Hey, so, in that case, 
can I join Franchouchou?

00:05:22.480 --> 00:05:25.380
That way I can help keep 
your secret safe, too!

00:05:26.270 --> 00:05:27.480
What do you mean?

00:05:27.480 --> 00:05:29.350
What a bold girl.

00:05:29.700 --> 00:05:31.090
Please!

00:05:45.780 --> 00:05:46.960
Really?!

00:05:46.960 --> 00:05:49.090
You didn't even think 
for a second, did you?!

00:05:49.090 --> 00:05:50.370
Don't just give up, man!

00:05:53.320 --> 00:05:56.950
Yay! Thank you so much! 
I'll do my very best, I promise!

00:05:57.410 --> 00:06:00.730
My name is Maimai Yuzuriha! 
Yes, that really is my name!

00:06:00.730 --> 00:06:02.210
You can call me Maimai!

00:06:02.450 --> 00:06:04.310
Maimai-chan...

00:06:04.310 --> 00:06:06.200
That's so cute! Her name can mean snail!

00:06:06.760 --> 00:06:08.760
Well, I've got a curfew!

00:06:08.760 --> 00:06:11.180
I'll be back tomorrow! Goodbye!

00:06:12.350 --> 00:06:15.230
So she's going to be... commuting?

00:06:15.230 --> 00:06:17.580
Is that even an option?

00:06:21.860 --> 00:06:24.970
Maimai-shi! Let's grab some frozen tapioca!

00:06:25.200 --> 00:06:27.560
Sorry! I have to taken a frozen raincheck!

00:06:27.560 --> 00:06:31.270
Huh? I didn't think there was any school 
festival stuff happening today.

00:06:31.270 --> 00:06:33.240
It's something else! Something very else!

00:06:33.600 --> 00:06:36.090
If Maimai is bailing on frozen tapioca...

00:06:36.090 --> 00:06:38.140
Is it some kind of romance thing?!

00:06:38.140 --> 00:06:39.130
Details, please!

00:06:39.130 --> 00:06:41.010
I mean, I definitely like them a lot, yes!

00:06:41.010 --> 00:06:43.100
And if you like 'em, join 'em!

00:06:43.580 --> 00:06:46.500
Good morning! Maimai's here!

00:06:47.780 --> 00:06:50.370
Are you serious about being an idol?

00:06:50.370 --> 00:06:51.160
I am!

00:06:51.540 --> 00:06:54.810
And you don't expect special treatment 
because you have dirt on us?

00:06:55.040 --> 00:06:56.180
I don't!

00:07:00.050 --> 00:07:01.030
Okay.

00:07:02.770 --> 00:07:05.850
Do you have any dance experience, Maimai?

00:07:05.850 --> 00:07:08.300
Not at all! I'm starting at zero!

00:07:08.300 --> 00:07:11.850
But I do know all your songs and dance
 moves from your shows and CDs!

00:07:11.850 --> 00:07:12.830
Really?!

00:07:12.830 --> 00:07:14.270
That's amazing, Maimai-chan!

00:07:17.500 --> 00:07:20.800
Five... four... Three, two, one.

00:07:20.800 --> 00:07:24.120
One, two, three, four...

00:07:24.380 --> 00:07:27.720
Five, six, seven, eight!

00:07:28.430 --> 00:07:30.020
How'd that even happen?

00:07:30.020 --> 00:07:33.130
I can see it in my head, but my 
body has trouble keeping up!

00:07:33.310 --> 00:07:36.260
Sakura, Sakura! This might 
just be funny as hell!

00:07:36.460 --> 00:07:38.970
I wonder if Maimai-chan's gonna be okay...

00:07:40.460 --> 00:07:41.870
Let's try again.

00:07:42.220 --> 00:07:42.970
Yeowch!

00:07:43.470 --> 00:07:45.240
Owowow...

00:07:45.240 --> 00:07:46.000
One more time.

00:07:46.000 --> 00:07:46.650
Yeow!

00:07:46.650 --> 00:07:47.580
And again.

00:07:47.580 --> 00:07:48.260
Oofta...

00:07:48.260 --> 00:07:48.980
Again.

00:07:48.980 --> 00:07:50.220
Hargble!

00:07:50.800 --> 00:07:52.840
Let's call it a day for now.

00:07:52.840 --> 00:07:53.750
I want to keep going!

00:07:53.950 --> 00:07:56.990
I want to be a real member of 
Franchouchou as soon as possible!

00:08:02.140 --> 00:08:04.820
Make sure to go over what 
we did today, okay?

00:08:04.820 --> 00:08:06.620
Okay! I'll come by tomorrow!

00:08:08.540 --> 00:08:10.870
Dude... Dude, is that...?

00:08:11.900 --> 00:08:15.340
It's got color! Holy crap, 
Sakura, it's in color!

00:08:15.610 --> 00:08:17.150
That is neat!

00:08:17.150 --> 00:08:18.720
Is... Is Oyajitchi still in it?

00:08:18.940 --> 00:08:22.290
He sure is! This is the 
20th anniversary model.

00:08:22.780 --> 00:08:26.990
Oh, hell, the old dude's still 
there?! I oughta kill him!

00:08:28.450 --> 00:08:30.280
You were really working hard today.

00:08:30.280 --> 00:08:31.950
I've still got lots to learn, though.

00:08:31.950 --> 00:08:34.330
Ai-chan mentioned she's impressed 
with how hard you tried.

00:08:34.330 --> 00:08:36.850
I just want everyone to accept me soon.

00:08:37.540 --> 00:08:40.600
How long have you been a fan 
of Franchouchou, Maimai-chan?

00:08:41.280 --> 00:08:44.210
Well, I had given up hope for Saga.

00:08:45.170 --> 00:08:48.310
I mean, don't you think it 
has a lot of potential?

00:08:49.010 --> 00:08:50.840
But nobody knows about it.

00:08:51.070 --> 00:08:53.870
I think it has to be some 
kind of Saga thing.

00:08:53.870 --> 00:08:56.380
I mean, if Saga was Fukuoka,

00:08:56.380 --> 00:08:58.880
its image would be having a lot of 
people and being really active,

00:08:58.880 --> 00:09:01.490
and everyone would be more interested!

00:09:01.490 --> 00:09:03.300
That's... not Saga anymore, though.

00:09:03.950 --> 00:09:06.570
But then, one day, I was reading <i>Sagazine</i>...

00:09:06.650 --> 00:09:08.520
<b><i>Angels Descend
 on Saga Rock!</i></b>

00:09:07.210 --> 00:09:10.340
And I was all, "Idols, in Saga?! No way!"

00:09:11.480 --> 00:09:14.620
Then I heard about you doing 
a show at the end of the year...

00:09:38.760 --> 00:09:40.180
M-Me?

00:09:40.440 --> 00:09:42.050
It was really amazing!

00:09:42.400 --> 00:09:43.970
Oh, wow...

00:09:44.450 --> 00:09:45.990
I don't know how to put it into words...

00:09:45.990 --> 00:09:50.350
but I was amazed someone could sing with 
an expression like that. Shine like that!

00:09:50.620 --> 00:09:53.950
And so, I started thinking more and 
more about how I wanted to be like you

00:09:53.950 --> 00:09:57.490
and live in Saga the same way that you do!

00:10:01.620 --> 00:10:03.270
Just like me...

00:10:03.570 --> 00:10:06.500
But the EFS show was a real mess.

00:10:06.820 --> 00:10:10.030
The atmosphere got to us in the crowd, too...

00:10:10.030 --> 00:10:14.420
I've never wished my voice was 
louder than I did on that day.

00:10:17.590 --> 00:10:20.570
But, after seeing you at Saga Arena,

00:10:20.570 --> 00:10:23.170
it made me realize how 
amazing Franchouchou is.

00:10:24.050 --> 00:10:27.950
It doesn't matter that you're zombies! 
You're the same as living folks!

00:10:28.360 --> 00:10:32.810
So I don't think you all need to worry 
so much about the makeup and stuff!

00:10:32.810 --> 00:10:36.350
Being able to perform the way 
you do is way more incredible!

00:10:36.840 --> 00:10:39.800
I might not be able to contribute much yet,

00:10:39.800 --> 00:10:43.700
but I'm willing to do whatever 
I can as a fellow member!

00:10:46.400 --> 00:10:48.040
Let's work hard together!

00:10:48.040 --> 00:10:48.780
Yeah!

00:10:49.450 --> 00:10:50.890
Isn't this kinda bad?!

00:10:50.870 --> 00:10:52.330
<b>Saganan Carnival Organization Committee</b>

00:10:51.130 --> 00:10:54.000
How are we all brainstorming and 
this and coming up with nothing?!

00:10:52.330 --> 00:10:54.000
<b>Saganan Carnival Main Stage</b>

00:10:52.330 --> 00:10:54.000
<b>Asparagus speed-reaping race  ->Not a good idea to rush! X</b>

00:10:52.330 --> 00:10:54.000
<b>Marubouro speed-eating tournament -> Too much of a choking hazard! X</b>

00:10:52.330 --> 00:10:54.000
<b>Mudball polishing competition -> Too dull! X</b>

00:10:52.330 --> 00:10:54.000
<b>Student's Eel Goby show and tell -> Rejected by teachers X</b>

00:10:54.210 --> 00:10:57.180
I guess we're gonna be doing the Miss 
Tsubozamurai pageant again this year...

00:10:57.400 --> 00:10:58.920
Don't give up so easy!

00:10:58.920 --> 00:11:01.010
Look at how terrible these ideas are!

00:11:01.010 --> 00:11:03.710
We oughta be able to manage 
at least one decent one!

00:11:03.710 --> 00:11:06.050
Diiing!

00:11:06.740 --> 00:11:09.030
A performance at a school festival?!

00:11:09.270 --> 00:11:11.630
If we get popular with high school students,

00:11:11.630 --> 00:11:15.710
it'll spread from there and make
 Franchouchou better known!

00:11:15.710 --> 00:11:19.280
Ei-yah! Whoosh, whoosh! Ei-yah! Whoosh, whoosh!

00:11:19.760 --> 00:11:23.280
Ei-yah! Whoosh, whoosh! Ei-yah! Whoosh, whoosh!

00:11:21.930 --> 00:11:23.280
High school, huh...

00:11:23.550 --> 00:11:24.990
That sounds fun!

00:11:24.990 --> 00:11:27.100
I'm interested, as well.

00:11:27.100 --> 00:11:28.550
Kotaro-san?

00:11:31.740 --> 00:11:34.420
You need to cut that crap out.
 You wanna die?

00:11:34.640 --> 00:11:38.290
You usually tend to pull in a real 
freak show in terms of audience...

00:11:38.290 --> 00:11:40.950
This'll be a good chance for us to 
take direct aim at the demographic

00:11:40.950 --> 00:11:42.180
that's gonna shape Saga's future.

00:11:42.180 --> 00:11:43.920
What about Maimai?

00:11:43.920 --> 00:11:46.300
She still hasn't been able to run through 
a routine without falling...

00:11:46.620 --> 00:11:49.450
You need to be ready for showtime, 
because you're going to be the star.

00:11:50.250 --> 00:11:54.880
This show, Franchouchou is going
 to be reborn as an Eight Wise Idols group,

00:11:54.880 --> 00:11:56.220
and Number Seven makes her debut.

00:11:57.720 --> 00:11:59.190
Do you think you can do it, Maimai-chan?

00:11:59.580 --> 00:12:02.570
A-As long as my body doesn't betray me!

00:12:02.570 --> 00:12:06.010
In that case, all you've gotta 
do is practice your butt off!

00:12:06.010 --> 00:12:07.820
Time to get psyched up, Maimai!

00:12:07.820 --> 00:12:11.330
Right! Come on, brain and body! Get in sync!

00:12:11.520 --> 00:12:14.550
Time for the new Franchouchou 
to strut our stuff!

00:12:14.550 --> 00:12:16.540
Yeah!

00:12:16.960 --> 00:12:21.970
Piping
 hot!!

00:12:31.560 --> 00:12:32.810
<b>Don't walk while 
staring at your phone</b>

00:12:37.750 --> 00:12:39.550
All right, looking good.

00:12:39.550 --> 00:12:40.560
Maimai-chan!

00:12:40.910 --> 00:12:43.500
You managed to stay upright this time.

00:12:43.500 --> 00:12:46.250
And with two days to spare before showtime.

00:12:46.730 --> 00:12:49.090
Th-Thank you so much!

00:12:49.830 --> 00:12:54.250
Um, why don't we all head to the bathhouse 
to get to know each other a little better?

00:12:55.280 --> 00:12:57.920
I love visiting them! I've got 
a few spots in mind that—

00:12:57.920 --> 00:13:01.520
Sorry, Maimai-chan, but that's 
one thing that's a no-go.

00:13:01.890 --> 00:13:04.020
I do like baths, but...

00:13:04.020 --> 00:13:06.080
Y'know, they make it hard to keep secrets!

00:13:06.080 --> 00:13:09.310
Oh, I'm sorry! I forgot all 
about the zombie thing!

00:13:09.310 --> 00:13:13.460
Hey, I'd love to go around 
your school instead!

00:13:13.460 --> 00:13:15.630
You wanna take the place over, huh, shrimpy?

00:13:15.630 --> 00:13:17.060
Not even!

00:13:17.350 --> 00:13:20.070
I don't have too many memories 
of high school, to be honest.

00:13:20.290 --> 00:13:21.340
Neither do I.

00:13:21.340 --> 00:13:25.170
I'd love to see how young people 
today go about their lives.

00:13:25.170 --> 00:13:28.160
Got it! I'll get permission from my teacher!

00:13:28.350 --> 00:13:30.250
Yay!

00:13:30.780 --> 00:13:33.170
The festival's tomorrow! Get a move on!

00:13:33.160 --> 00:13:34.370
<b>Principal's Office</b>

00:13:35.420 --> 00:13:37.750
That was seriously so ugh...

00:13:38.770 --> 00:13:41.800
Sorry... they all ran off 
as soon as we got here.

00:13:41.800 --> 00:13:45.580
It's fine! Everyone's really excited 
about the cultural festival tomorrow...

00:13:45.580 --> 00:13:47.770
I think they'll have fun 
no matter where they go.

00:13:47.770 --> 00:13:50.550
The prep is half the fun, 
after all. It takes me back!

00:13:51.030 --> 00:13:54.090
What were you like in 
high school, Sakura-san?

00:13:55.740 --> 00:13:57.640
I was kind of dead on the inside.

00:13:58.130 --> 00:14:01.490
Some stuff had happened, and it felt 
like nothing I did was gonna work out...

00:14:01.950 --> 00:14:05.010
So I had trouble taking anything seriously.

00:14:05.010 --> 00:14:06.990
You were really negative, then?

00:14:07.260 --> 00:14:08.390
Yeah...

00:14:08.390 --> 00:14:11.800
But after seeing Iron Frill... and Ai-chan...

00:14:11.800 --> 00:14:15.640
I decided to try again
and keep moving forward!

00:14:16.640 --> 00:14:19.910
I was so happy when I found out they 
were having auditions for new members.

00:14:20.130 --> 00:14:24.750
Around this time, I would be practicing 
in a corner of the classroom...

00:14:25.890 --> 00:14:28.790
I died before I could apply, though.

00:14:29.860 --> 00:14:34.070
But now that I'm a zombie, 
I can try new things again.

00:14:34.070 --> 00:14:38.110
After meeting the others, I think I can 
take on any kind of challenge now.

00:14:38.110 --> 00:14:40.640
Even getting revenge at EFS.

00:14:42.620 --> 00:14:45.230
Wait, EFS? You're going to 
do another show there?!

00:14:45.230 --> 00:14:46.470
Did no one mention that?

00:14:46.470 --> 00:14:48.180
Not at all, no!

00:14:48.180 --> 00:14:50.740
I mean, that show was such a disaster!

00:14:50.740 --> 00:14:53.130
Why wander back into hell like that?

00:14:54.580 --> 00:14:56.740
That's just how Franchouchou is.

00:14:57.800 --> 00:15:01.260
EFS was a huge mistake, yeah...

00:15:01.260 --> 00:15:04.990
We got into debt and we couldn't 
even do idol stuff for a while.

00:15:05.300 --> 00:15:07.640
But none of us gave up.

00:15:08.300 --> 00:15:10.390
We're scared of messing up again,

00:15:10.390 --> 00:15:13.600
but I know if we're together, 
we can get through it!

00:15:13.600 --> 00:15:15.750
What we're all way more scared of...

00:15:16.330 --> 00:15:20.010
is giving up and becoming 
regular old walking dead.

00:15:21.730 --> 00:15:24.560
Over and over, we keep standing up...

00:15:24.560 --> 00:15:29.350
I think, for us, living means chasing 
our dreams even though we're dead.

00:15:31.960 --> 00:15:36.070
Oh, sorry! I think I got kinda... 
Oh, what am I even saying?

00:15:38.070 --> 00:15:39.480
Maimai-chan?

00:15:39.480 --> 00:15:41.470
That's who Franchouchou is...

00:15:41.470 --> 00:15:46.090
Yeah! And having you aboard 
is gonna be a big help!

00:15:46.090 --> 00:15:48.830
Let's make sure the show 
tomorrow goes great!

00:15:51.070 --> 00:15:53.990
<i>That's who Franchouchou's Number One is!</i>

00:15:54.400 --> 00:15:57.240
Maimai-chan, you okay?

00:15:57.240 --> 00:16:00.180
Huh? Um, maybe she didn't hear me?

00:16:00.880 --> 00:16:02.770
Maimai-chan?

00:16:02.770 --> 00:16:06.540
You forgot something! Me!

00:16:06.540 --> 00:16:07.890
Seriously...?

00:16:08.150 --> 00:16:09.990
Reiwa

