00:16:32.940 --> 00:16:35.540
<i>Hey, hey, hey, hey, come on, everybody!</i>

00:16:35.540 --> 00:16:38.060
<i>Hey, hey, hey, hey, let's get real today!</i>

00:16:37.060 --> 00:16:38.870
Huh? Who's that?

00:16:38.060 --> 00:16:41.180
<i>Hey, hey, hey, hey, hey, hey, hey! Yeah!</i>

00:16:38.870 --> 00:16:39.880
There's someone new!

00:16:42.250 --> 00:16:44.710
Why?! What's Maimai-shi doing up there?!

00:16:44.710 --> 00:16:45.860
I have no idea what's gonna happen!

00:16:45.860 --> 00:16:51.370
<i>Aw, my bangs were cut too 
short, but when you saw</i>

00:16:51.370 --> 00:16:53.880
<i>And gave me that "Like"</i>

00:16:53.880 --> 00:16:56.280
<i>When I got home, I thought 
maybe it wouldn't be so bad!</i>

00:16:56.280 --> 00:16:59.110
<i>Gotta dash out the door cuz I'm running late</i>

00:16:59.110 --> 00:17:01.870
<i>And try to sneak a peek in the classroom</i>

00:17:01.870 --> 00:17:05.040
<i>Uh-oh, looks like there's 
a pop quiz coming up!</i>

00:17:05.040 --> 00:17:09.880
<i>Charging straight into school life!</i>

00:17:11.600 --> 00:17:17.370
<i>The school girls are here to stay! 
And now it's time for happy days!</i>

00:17:17.370 --> 00:17:22.170
<i>Skipping, jumping, it's gonna take more 
than a traffic cone to stop me!</i>

00:17:22.170 --> 00:17:27.520
<i>We'll hang together through the day! 
Then after school is golden time!</i>

00:17:27.890 --> 00:17:30.620
<i>It's your treat, right? So, 
crepes or maybe donuts!</i>

00:17:30.620 --> 00:17:38.610
<i>Take it all together, 
because now is forever!</i>

00:17:40.930 --> 00:17:43.780
<i>Hey, hey, hey, hey, let's get wild, baby!</i>

00:17:43.780 --> 00:17:46.350
<i>Hey, hey, hey, hey, come on, everybody!</i>

00:17:46.350 --> 00:17:48.930
<i>Hey, hey, hey, hey, let's get real today!</i>

00:17:48.930 --> 00:17:51.380
<i>Hey, hey, hey, hey, hey, hey, hey!</i>

00:17:53.600 --> 00:17:59.220
<i>The school girls are here to stay! 
And now it's time for happy days!</i>

00:17:59.220 --> 00:18:04.030
<i>Skipping, jumping, it's gonna take more 
than a traffic cone to stop me!</i>

00:18:04.030 --> 00:18:09.790
<i>We'll hang together through the day! 
Then after school is golden time!</i>

00:18:09.790 --> 00:18:12.590
<i>It's your treat, right? So, 
crepes or maybe donuts!</i>

00:18:12.590 --> 00:18:20.410
<i>Take it all together, 
because now is forever!</i>

00:18:31.340 --> 00:18:33.350
That was awesome, Maimai-shi!

00:18:33.350 --> 00:18:35.550
Look at you! The star of Saganan Carnival!

00:18:35.950 --> 00:18:38.420
Hey there! We're Franchouchou.

00:18:38.730 --> 00:18:42.590
This our first time performing
 at a school festival today, so...

00:18:42.590 --> 00:18:46.560
And we kinda... Well, starting today, 
there's eight of us! And that's it!

00:18:47.060 --> 00:18:48.110
Right!

00:18:48.100 --> 00:18:50.650
Franchouchou: Debut of the Eight Wise Idols!

00:18:48.960 --> 00:18:52.700
I'm Franchouchou's Number Seven! 
It's nice to meet you all!

00:18:53.360 --> 00:18:55.270
You joined?!

00:18:55.540 --> 00:18:57.440
That's as sudden as it gets!

00:18:57.440 --> 00:18:59.400
You really never know what's gonna happen!

00:18:59.770 --> 00:19:01.980
And here's Number Seven with a few words!

00:19:02.490 --> 00:19:04.050
Let 'em have it.

00:19:08.680 --> 00:19:15.610
I want to thank you all for coming to see 
our special show here at Saganan Carnival!

00:19:17.770 --> 00:19:20.990
I also have something very 
important to announce.

00:19:24.700 --> 00:19:27.430
I, Franchouchou's Number Seven...

00:19:28.710 --> 00:19:32.170
will be graduating from 
Franchouchou after this show!

00:19:37.500 --> 00:19:42.820
Please enjoy my last song as Franchouchou's 
Number Seven... "Into The Light."

00:19:57.800 --> 00:20:09.200
<i>And now I leave for a distant journey</i>

00:20:09.200 --> 00:20:20.320
<i>When I close my eyelids, 
the memories start to flow forth</i>

00:20:20.320 --> 00:20:23.950
I've been thinking it over ever since 
I talked to Sakura-san yesterday

00:20:23.950 --> 00:20:25.190
and came to a decision.

00:20:26.280 --> 00:20:30.840
I thought I was the same as 
you all, but that's not true.

00:20:31.130 --> 00:20:33.870
It's not about you looking 
pale or anything...

00:20:34.200 --> 00:20:36.660
I think that you all lived 
out your short lives

00:20:36.660 --> 00:20:39.800
as best you could when you were alive.

00:20:39.800 --> 00:20:43.410
The reason you shine is 
because, even after dying,

00:20:43.410 --> 00:20:47.710
you keep rising up, intent on 
living life to the fullest.

00:20:48.440 --> 00:20:50.600
I think if I want to shine like you all,

00:20:51.090 --> 00:20:54.280
I need to live out my life 
here in Saga, first.

00:20:54.790 --> 00:20:57.780
That's why I'm going to 
graduate from Franchouchou,

00:20:57.780 --> 00:21:01.100
and live my life in the 
Reiwa era as best I can!

00:21:02.470 --> 00:21:05.970
That concludes the statement 
from Maimai Yuzuriha!

00:21:05.970 --> 00:21:09.450
Ei-yah! Maimai!

00:21:09.450 --> 00:21:22.290
<i>Goodbye until we meet 
again, my warm memories</i>

00:21:30.940 --> 00:21:33.330
I think you're really amazing. 
In a couple of ways.

00:21:33.330 --> 00:21:35.190
You came and went like a storm.

00:21:35.190 --> 00:21:37.310
Even though your name's pretty slow-going!

00:21:37.310 --> 00:21:40.580
Never forget the boldness that got you here.

00:21:40.860 --> 00:21:43.490
It has been such an honor!

00:21:43.490 --> 00:21:45.800
If you ever end up dead 
for reals, look us up.

00:21:45.800 --> 00:21:46.440
'Kay!

00:21:46.780 --> 00:21:48.360
Oh, this is for you, Saki-san.

00:21:50.190 --> 00:21:50.870
Huh?!

00:21:51.220 --> 00:21:53.810
Seriously?! But isn't this 
thing super awesome?!

00:21:53.810 --> 00:21:55.010
I'd love for you to have it!

00:21:56.050 --> 00:21:59.390
For real? Thank you! I swear, 
I'll take great care of it!

00:22:00.110 --> 00:22:01.760
It wasn't for long,

00:22:02.070 --> 00:22:06.300
but it was a lot of fun having you 
in Franchouchou, Maimai-chan!

00:22:07.260 --> 00:22:08.660
I feel the same way!

00:22:11.730 --> 00:22:12.920
I'm sorry.

00:22:13.140 --> 00:22:17.370
It's okay. It was because I got 
mixed up in the first place.

00:22:17.850 --> 00:22:20.940
And thanks to that, I got to have 
an experience I'll never forget.

00:22:21.310 --> 00:22:22.280
I see.

00:22:22.720 --> 00:22:25.770
I'll be sure to keep Franchouchou's secret!

00:22:25.770 --> 00:22:27.940
I'd hate to lose my role models, after all!

00:22:32.980 --> 00:22:34.070
Thank you.

00:22:37.170 --> 00:22:38.800
Thanks again!

00:22:37.760 --> 00:22:39.110
Goodbye!

00:22:38.140 --> 00:22:39.580
See you around!

00:22:38.960 --> 00:22:40.680
Everyone!

00:22:40.860 --> 00:22:44.420
Thank you very much!

